                    definition (changed made in order to make RiC-O compliant with RiC-CM 0.2; the
                    name of this property in RiC-O 0.1 was \"involves\")."""@en];
                         rico:RiCCMCorrespondingComponent """RiC-R058 ('has or had participant'
            relation)"""@en.
rico:hasOrHadPhysicalLocation a owl:ObjectProperty;
                              rdfs:comment """Connects a Place to one of its past or present Physical
